{"id":"wb-8-408","name":"沙湾留耕堂","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"沙湾留耕堂","text":"沙湾留耕堂位于广东省广州市番禺区沙湾街道沙北村庐江周道，是沙湾何氏家族的宗祠。留耕堂始建于公元1335年（元朝至元元年），建筑雄伟大气，保留了精美的岭南石雕、木雕、砖雕技艺，是优秀的岭南特色建筑。1989年6月成为广东省文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B2%99%E6%B9%BE%E7%95%99%E8%80%95%E5%A0%82","revisionId":90159954,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=90159954","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/7e60f64e0886d6af46253e2e.jpg","title":"Guangzhou_Panyu_Shawan_Liugeng_Tang_20190922.162333.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Guangzhou_Panyu_Shawan_Liugeng_Tang_20190922.162333.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/af/Guangzhou_Panyu_Shawan_Liugeng_Tang_20190922.162333.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"古海岸遗址","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​沙灣留耕堂，位於廣東省廣州市番禺區番禺區沙灣街道北村廬江周道。屬於全國重點文物保護單位。","width":320,"height":213}}